            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wi-Fi"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can still access Ice's settings by right-clicking an empty area in the menu bar": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你仍然可以在選單列的空白處按右鍵來打開 Ice 的設定"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You may need to log out for the changes to take effect.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你可能需要登出才能讓變更生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Download": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下載"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Later": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "稍後"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You're up to date!": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已是最新版本！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Failed to check for updates": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "無法檢查更新項目"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ice %@ is now available. You are currently using version %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ice %@ 現已推出，你目前使用的是版本 %@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ice %@ is currently the newest version available.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ice %@ 是目前可用的最新版本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server returned an unexpected response (%lld).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "伺服器傳回了非預期的回應（%lld）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On macOS 27 and later, Ice's menu bar icons, hidden sections, and the Ice Bar are disabled. To show this window again, open Ice from Finder or Launchpad.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 macOS 27 及以後版本，Ice 的選單列圖示、隱藏區段及 Ice Bar 均已停用。如需再次顯示此視窗，請從 Finder 或「啟動台」重新開啟 Ice。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Arranging menu bar items is not available on macOS 27 and later": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 27 及以後版本無法排列選單列項目"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Failed to save the menu bar item spacing (exit code %d).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "無法儲存選單列項目間距（結束代碼 %d）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS reverted the menu bar item spacing after it was applied.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "套用選單列項目間距後，macOS 將其還原了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This version of macOS may not support changing the menu bar item spacing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此版本的 macOS 可能不支援變更選單列項目間距。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Relaunch apps to apply the spacing?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "要重新開啟 App 來套用間距嗎？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These apps will quit and reopen. Save your work in them first. Apps that don't quit (for example, because they have unsaved changes) are left open.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "以下 App 會結束並重新開啟，請先儲存其中的工作。無法結束的 App（例如有未儲存的變更）會維持開啟。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Relaunch Apps": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重新開啟 App"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The spacing will apply as apps reopen": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "間距會在 App 重新開啟後套用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each app uses the new spacing the next time it opens, or after you log out and back in.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每個 App 會在下次開啟時，或你登出再登入後，使用新的間距。"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version": "1.0"
}
